# Auto-push after commit

When the user asks for a commit (or a task that includes committing), push to `origin` immediately after a successful commit.

- Do not ask "want me to push?"
- Use `git push -u origin HEAD` (or equivalent) after commit succeeds
- Report the push result briefly in the same response as the commit
- Still never force-push to main/master unless explicitly requested
